# Publish to Railway

When a player-facing change is done, commit it and push `main`. Railway deploys from that branch to https://burbank-walkabout-production.up.railway.app.

- Do this without waiting to be asked. A finished fix is not done while it exists only on this machine.
- Do not commit `.env` or other secrets.
- Confirm the Railway deployment is Online before saying the change is live.
